\u0010\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0010\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0010\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0010\u0000\u0000\u0000\u000f\u0000\u0000\u0000\u000f\u0000\u0000\u0000\u000f\u0000\u0000\u0000;\u0000\u0000\u0000;\u0000\u0000\u0000\u00f6\u00ffi\u0000\u00a4\u0001Ever gotten really annoyed at those little dogs that like to latch on to your ankles and nip at them?  Well, an unnamed clan mech designer though of after hearing about them.  He designed the Anklebiter, and it has proved an annoyance ever since.\r\n\r\nThis design devotes most of its 30 tons to Speed and Armor, making sure the armor is full, and the speed is outrageous.  All variants car"
